  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Standard Bank of Malawi (SBM), previously known as the Commercial Bank of Malawi, is one of the country&apos;s national banks. It has 19 branches across Malawi and a workforce of 600.The bank began life in 1969 and after several changes &#x2013; including an IPO &#x2013;  Standard Bank became the majority shareholder in 2001.</narrative>
  </description>
